    <string name="welcome_terms_subtitle">Welcome to Boompala. Please review the following terms regarding content nature and data privacy before getting started:</string>
    <string name="welcome_disclaimer_card_title">🔮</string>
    <string name="welcome_disclaimer_card_content">All divination features including Six Yao, Mei Hua, Xiao Liu Ren, Daily Fortune, and Tarot are based on traditional cultural classics and are intended strictly for cultural research, philosophical reflection, and entertainment. They do not constitute professional medical, legal, or financial advice.</string>
    <string name="welcome_offline_card_title">🛡️</string>
    <string name="welcome_offline_card_content">Boompala is a completely standalone offline tool. It requires zero network permissions, zero location access, and does not collect any personal data. All readings and settings remain securely stored on your local watch device.</string>
