    <string name="welcome_sources_card_content">I Ching canonical texts are derived from Wikisource (CC BY-SA 4.0), Ganzhi calendar algorithms from 6tail/lunar-java (MIT), and Tarot illustrations from 1909 public domain restorations (CC0 1.0). Special thanks to open-source contributors.</string>
